WEBVTT

00:02:57.714 --> 00:03:01.489
To be able to do so, 
Education City was created

00:03:01.763 --> 00:03:05.993
by building those partnerships 
with an institution of high quality,

00:03:06.308 --> 00:03:11.373
by attracting the best college 
or the best program per university.

00:03:11.373 --> 00:03:14.823
So, the whole idea was not really
to attract one single university,

00:03:14.823 --> 00:03:17.923
the idea was to target 
the high-quality program,

00:03:17.923 --> 00:03:21.403
the high-quality research institution 
into Education City

00:03:21.403 --> 00:03:25.945
in specific areas of a very important 
future development of the region.

00:03:26.357 --> 00:03:30.797
And the whole model is about
not only graduating students,